'''Huggy & Friends Skin Pack'''<ref>{{Tweet|mobgamesstudios|2024545143462703440|We have more experiments taking over Minecraft now 👀|February 19, 2026}}</ref> is a [[skin pack]] developed by [[Spark Universe]], themed after the ''{{w|Poppy Playtime}}'' video game and merchandise franchise.

