|DogDay
|[[File:DogDay skin render.png|60px]] {{Anchor|DogDay}}
|One of the many living toys made in the image of the DogDay plush from the 1989 Smiling Critters toyline.
|
|-
|CatNap
|[[File:CatNap skin render.png|60px]] {{Anchor|CatNap}}
|One of the many living toys made in the image of the CatNap plush from the 1989 Smiling Critters toyline. Cartoon character portrayed by Elijah Delaney.
|
