== Trivia ==

* Prior to the release of the skin pack, an [[add-on]] was made for the same property, also released by Spark Universe. However, it is not considered official to the [[Minecraft (franchise)|''Minecraft'' franchise]].
* In a promotional image for the skin pack, Doey has a noticeably different texture, with the clay hands resembling claws and a tentacle.<ref>{{Tweet|SparkUniverse|2025652047857557970|The whole crew 🤝}}</ref> Boxy Boo's texture also appears reversed in the image.

